# mute.scn: B mutes the buzzer and a second press brings it back, shared by scenario_host and rt_test (pocketstation/tools/scenario.py).
# Author: suinevere
# The game asks for the same tone before, during and after the mute; muted calls reach the buzzer as silence.
enable 0x0100
tick 1
buzz 96
idle 1
press 0x80 1
buzz 96
idle 1
release 0x80 2
buzz 96
idle 1
press 0x80 3
buzz 96
idle 1
release 0x80 4
buzz 0
